  "keyFeatures": [
    "Maintained Action Maps for supported websites (ordering, booking, submitting, tracking)",
    "Streamable HTTP MCP server at mcp.agentweb.us/mcp",
    "Claim-link and email-code agent account signup flows",
    "Target-site account connections with polling",
    "Scoped payment authority with Dodo hosted checkout",
    "Webhook-backed credit fulfillment and verification artifacts",
    "read_page and discover tools usable without authentication",
    "Per-action credit metering with automatic refund on failure",
    "AgentWeb Card for agent-initiated payments (Pro/Max)",
    "Business install flow (scan, plan, PR generation, verify)"
